<a name="intro"></a>
<h3>Introduction</h3>

The <a href="../classes/html/classsys.html">sys class</a> provides methods for getting information about the operating system and controlling the state of the operating system.


<a name="info"></a>
<h3>Getting System Information</h3>

In this example, various bits of system information are printed out.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@sys.cpp.html@
}}}
}}}

Note that not all systems support every piece of information.  If a piece of information is unsupported, then a -1 is returned.


